From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: filipi87 <filipi87@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:44:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] daily-selftest-app: add examples/DailySelfTest

Minimal Expo app that runs automated checks of the Daily-specific features
on an emulator, simulator or device (native audio APIs, audio routing,
device listing, devicechange, camera switching, Android screen share).
scripts/run-selftest.sh launches it and fails unless every check passes;
npm run install-local installs this checkout through npm pack.
